      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLACK CHIP (1) tends to drift back and work into the race, finishing out of the placings two back before charging home into the minors latest when third (31.06) in a Invitation at this track last time. Form here at the trip sound including 10 wins. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Can find winning form. CARE FACTOR (4) comes off a (30.83) win last time, scoring by 2 lengths in a Invitation over 530m at this track. Has four wins already from this draw. Looks a key chance on best figures. YARRAMUNDI COCO (2) is in consistent form, jumping from this same box when a 1.75 lengths second in a Other at Gawler and making it back to back minors. Safe beginner and drawn well close to the inside. Must include in calculations. JALAPENO GEM (7) is worth another chance despite missing the top-three here most recently.",
